  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/zen-browser/desktop/zipball/1.23.2b",
  "body": "# Zen Stable Release\n\n\n## New Features\n- Added an 'open library' command to the command palette.\n- You can now right-click the media tab in the Library to disable it.\n\n## Fixes\n- Changed session backup file names to use local dates ([#15806](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/15806))\n- Fixed the library getting stuck after opening and closing it quickly ([#15833](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/15833))\n- Fixed blocked/unsafe downloads not having the choice to be opened or saved. ([#15809](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/15809))\n- Fixed moving multiple tabs to new window irrecoverably loses unloaded tabs. ([#15810](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/15810))\n- Fixed the sidebar having too much minimum width when they are aligned to the right. ([#15794](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/15794))\n- Fixed HEIC media being listed in the media tab but do not render correctly. ([#15778](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/15778))\n- Fixed space-assigned bookmarks not being saved anymore. ([#12721](https://github.com/zen-browser/desktop/issues/12721))\n- Fixed a memory leak issue on startup.\n- Other bug fixes and improvements.\n",
